==Norwegian Bokmål==

===Etymology===
{{root|nb|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁-|*h₂el-}}
From {{der|nb|NL.|abdōminālis||abdominal}}, from {{bor|nb|la|abdōmen||belly, abdomen; gluttony}} (with the suffix {{m|la|-ālis|pos=forms adjectives}}, from {{der|nb|ine-pro|*-li-}}, possibly from {{m|ine-pro|*h₂el-||to grow, nourish}}), possibly from '''both''' {{m|la|abdō||I hide, conceal}}, from {{m|la|ab-||from, away, off}}, from {{m|la|ab||from, away from, on, in}}, from {{der|nb|itc-pro|*ab}}, from {{der|nb|ine-pro|*h₂epó||off, away}} (+ the ending {{m|la|*dō||put}}, from {{der|nb|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁-||to do, put, place}})  + '''and''' from {{m|la|-men|pos=forms neuter nouns}}, from {{der|nb|itc-pro|*-men}}, from {{der|nb|ine-pro|*-mn̥|pos=creates action nouns or result nouns}}.

Equivalent to {{suffix|nb|abdomen|al}}, first part from {{bor|nb|la|abdōmen||belly, abdomen; gluttony}}, possibly from '''both''' {{m|la|abdō||I hide, conceal}}, from {{m|la|ab-||from, away, off}}, from {{m|la|ab||from, away from, on, in}}, from {{der|nb|itc-pro|*ab}}, from {{der|nb|ine-pro|*h₂epó||off, away}} (+ the ending {{m|la|*dō||put}}, from {{der|nb|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁-||to do, put, place}})  + '''and''' from {{m|la|-men|pos=forms neuter nouns}}, from {{der|nb|itc-pro|*-men}}, from {{der|nb|ine-pro|*-mn̥|pos=creates action nouns or result nouns}}. Last part from {{der|nb|fr|-al||-al}}, from {{der|nb|frm|-}}, from {{der|nb|fro|-al}}, from {{der|nb|la|-ālis}}, from {{der|nb|ine-pro|*-li-}}.

